<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第六步 · 推广：一个参数装下竞争与合谋</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="96" width="864" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>后人把“对手产量给定”改写成一个猜想：我多生产 1 单位时，预计对手会跟着变动多少？记这个量为 <formula><latex><![CDATA[v]]></latex></formula>。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="154" width="400" height="62"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[q=\frac{a-c}{(3+v)\,b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="430" topLeftY="154" width="482" height="62"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>每家厂商的均衡产量</p></content></shape><table topLeftX="48" topLeftY="228" width="864" height="160"><colgroup><col width="150"/><col width="300"/><col width="190"/><col width="224"/></colgroup><tr height="48"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>v 的取值</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>含义</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>每家产量</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>行业总产量</p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[v=0]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>对手不回应（古诺）</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a-c}{3b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{2(a-c)}{3b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[v=1]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>对手等量跟随（合谋）</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a-c}{4b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a-c}{2b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td></tr></table><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="354" width="864" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[v=1]]></latex></formula> 时行业总产量等于垄断产量：谁都知道多卖会引来报复，谁也就不敢多卖。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="416" width="864" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>知识创造的要点：把一条“非此即彼”的假设换成可取值的参数，模型就从解释一种情况，变成解释一整族情况。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [8] --></p><p>把“对手不会理我”这条硬假设，换成一个参数 v：我多卖一单位，对手会跟着变动多少。</p><p>代入利润最大化，得到 q＝(a − c)/[(3＋v)b]。v 取 0 就是古诺；v 取 1 时行业产量正好是垄断产量。</p><p>经济学里把这类猜想叫作推测变差；它说明一个模型可以同时容纳竞争与合谋两种结果。</p></content></note></slide>